KV_URL=redis://...
REDIS_URL=redis://...
ALCHEMY_RPC=https://eth-mainnet.g.alchemy.com/v2/YOUR_ALCHEMY_KEY
ALCHEMY_ETH_URL=https://eth-mainnet.g.alchemy.com/v2/YOUR_ALCHEMY_KEY
PRIVATE_KEY=0x... ETH private key with ETH for gas (owner)
CONTRACT_ADDRESS=0x... Deployed CipherJohnDistributor.sol address (ERC20)
PRIVATE_KEY_TRON=... 64 hex char TRON private key (no 0x)
CONTRACT_ADDRESS_TRC20=T... (optional, if using contract, else direct USDT)
TRONGRID_API_KEY=... Get from trongrid.io
API_SECRET_KEY=... (if you keep old main api)